<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="NEXUS • Real-Time Intelligence Network — Satellites, X, primary sources, court docs. Live threat intelligence powered by AI.">
    <title>NEXUS • Real-Time Intelligence Network</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --pulse: #14b8a6;
            --ink: #e8eef2;
            --bg: #070b10;
            --muted: #9aabba;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }

        .header-font {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        }

        .live-pulse {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--pulse);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.7);
            animation: pulse 2s ease-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(20, 184, 166, 0); }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .live-pulse { animation: none; }
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 28px 24px 8px;
        }

        .wordmark {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            line-height: 0.9;
        }

        .wordmark span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.42em;
            letter-spacing: 0.28em;
            color: var(--pulse);
        }

        main {
            max-width: 40rem;
            padding: 12px 24px 48px;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <span class="live-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h1 class="wordmark header-font">NEXUS<span>NEWS</span></h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <p>Real-time intelligence network. Satellites, primary sources, and court documents, read from the Nexus desk.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
